<title>USA: Tenneco completes packaging acquisition.</title>
<headline>Tenneco completes packaging acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenneco Inc said it has completed the acquisition of the protective and flexible packaging division of NV Koninklijke KNP BT for $375 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition of the division, which will become part of Tenneco Packaging, consists of a protective packaging business with operations in Europe and North America and a European flexible packaging business.</p>
<p>The combined operations accounted for $542 million in 1996 sales and employ some 3,000 worldwide.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
